{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in an endless nightmare, Ayumi wakes in a cursed library where reality bends and time loops without end. Each cycle drags her deeper into the mystery, forcing her to confront unsettling truths hidden within the stacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the library\u2019s eerie corridors, solve challenging puzzles, and piece together the fragments of Ayumi\u2019s past. But with every loop, the sense of dread grows stronger, and escape feels further away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror set in a looping-world environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments inspired by Japanese urban legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted puzzles that test observation and logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic scares that respond to player choices and actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your decisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth and escape the cycle, or remain forever trapped within the library\u2019s walls?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555930?t=1757694679","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555930?t=1757694679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555930/d321c597c458edcbaac22e200f2136d70c0bc12f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757694679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555930/d321c597c458edcbaac22e200f2136d70c0bc12f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757694679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"descri